{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26555","headline":"送崔玄亮赴果州冬夜宴韩卿宅 · 姚合","name":"送崔玄亮赴果州冬夜宴韩卿宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兰烛照重茵，飞盃复几分。\n主人寒不寐，上客晓离羣。\n骑吏缘青壁，旌旗度白云。\n劒铭生藓色，巴字叠冰文。\n华省思僊侣，疲民爱使君。\n泠泠唯自适，郡邸有谁闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26555.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26555","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}